# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# Secrets / environment
#
# All `.env` files are ignored. The `.env.example` files and the three
# exceptions below are tracked directly: they never carry secrets
# (paths/parameters only). NOTE: the pipeline env lives at
# `src/medrag/pipeline/cli/.env`; the whitelist path follows it (the old
# `!pipeline/.env` line was a dead rule -- there is no .env there anymore).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
!chatbot-corpus/document_info/.env
!chatbot-corpus/product_info/.env
!src/medrag/pipeline/cli/.env
*.secrets

# Old benchmark/config.json — NO LONGER READ: grading tuning moved to
# benchmark/config/default.toml and the secret (api_key) to .env. A local
# leftover copy can be deleted safely; kept ignored so it cannot be
# committed by mistake.
benchmark/config.json

# facts/: home of the information layer (spec DB). The canonical spec_key
# dictionary (facts/vocabulary/) stays committed. The entries further down in
# this block are DATA ballast — they exist on disk but are deliberately not
# tracked: facts/db/specs.db + specs.db.legacy_* copies, facts/queue/*.jsonl,
# facts/ledger/, facts/absent/, facts/snapshots/, facts/extraction_runs/.
# CAUTION: the generic `build/` rule below means there must be NO directory
# named `build` under facts/; the `runs/` and `review/` rules would also
# swallow the names facts/runs and facts/review — WHICH IS WHY the
# ExtractionRun store is `facts/extraction_runs/` and NOT `facts/runs/`, and
# why review_cli.py writes its reports to `facts/db/review_report_*.md`
# instead of a colliding `facts/review/`.
# specs.db runs in WAL mode; the -wal/-shm side files appear while a writer
# connection is active — same discipline as specs.db itself, kept out of git.
facts/db/specs.db
facts/db/specs.db-wal
facts/db/specs.db-shm
facts/db/specs.db.legacy_2026-07-28_08-05-41
facts/db/specs.db.legacy_2026-07-31_13-10-51
facts/db/specs.db.legacy_2026-08-03_14-36-13
facts/db/specs.db.legacy_2026-08-03_15-30-48
facts/db/specs.db.legacy_2026-08-03_15-43-41
facts/db/specs.db.legacy_2026-08-04_08-16-31
facts/db/specs.db.legacy_2026-08-04_10-13-35
facts/db/specs.db.legacy_2026-08-06_09-36-09
facts/db/specs.db.legacy_2026-08-07_08-44-12
facts/db/specs.db.legacy_2026-08-07_11-05-25
facts/db/specs.db.legacy_20260724
facts/queue/no_key_match.jsonl
facts/queue/ambiguous_product.jsonl
facts/queue/new_key_proposals.jsonl
facts/ledger/*.jsonl
facts/absent/
facts/snapshots/
facts/extraction_runs/
chatbot-corpus/product_info/product_nodes.json

